# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
build
docs

src/mediakit/

# The mediakit is generated, except for the two logos the site serves to visitors, which are
# committed on purpose. Written as a ladder rather than as `static/mediakit/` plus a negation
# because git never looks inside an excluded directory: a `!` under one is silently inert, so the
# contents are excluded step by step to leave somewhere for the exception to apply. What is ignored
# is unchanged apart from the two files named — anything else added here, at any depth, is ignored.
static/mediakit/*
!static/mediakit/logo/
static/mediakit/logo/*
!static/mediakit/logo/110x110-white.png
!static/mediakit/logo/1920x1920-banner.png


